@startuml
title State diagram for the Online Quiz System

[*] --> Registered : Register

state "Registered" as Registered
state "Logged in" as LoggedIn
state "Teacher logged in" as TeacherLoggedIn
state "Student logged in" as StudentLoggedIn
state "Quiz created" as QuizCreated
state "Quiz edited" as QuizEdited
state "Quiz saved" as QuizSaved
state "Quiz posted" as QuizPosted
state "Quiz results viewed" as QuizResultsViewed

Registered --> LoggedIn : Login
LoggedIn --> TeacherLoggedIn : Continue as teacher
LoggedIn --> StudentLoggedIn : Continue as student

TeacherLoggedIn --> QuizCreated : Create new quiz
TeacherLoggedIn --> QuizEdited : Edit existing quiz
TeacherLoggedIn --> QuizSaved : Save as draft
TeacherLoggedIn --> QuizPosted : Post for students

StudentLoggedIn --> J1 : Select quiz
J1 --> QuizAnswered : Answer selected quiz
QuizAnswered --> QuizSubmitted : Submit quiz
QuizSubmitted --> QuizResultsViewed : View result

QuizCreated --> QuizEdited : Edit created quiz
QuizEdited --> QuizSaved : Save edited quiz
QuizSaved --> QuizPosted : Post saved quiz
QuizPosted --> QuizResultsViewed : View results after posting

QuizResultsViewed --> [*]

@enduml
